text\": \"1: <!-- simplicio-contract:begin -->\\n2: contract: simplicio-loop/cross-repo-integration\\n3: schema: simplicio.skill-reference/v1\\n4: purpose: Moved out of `SKILL.md` \u00a7 Cross-repo dependencies as part of the #119 shrink.\\n5: rules: Read only when the parent SKILL.md points here; mutable data lives in the footer, never in this header.\\n6: <!-- simplicio-contract:end -->\\n7: \\n8: # Cross-repo dependencies (`simplicio` CLI, optional) \u2014 full detail\\n9: \\n10: Moved out of `SKILL.md` \u00a7 Cross-repo dependencies as part of the #119 shrink.\\n11: \\n12: The simplicio-loop can optionally call out to the **simplicio CLI** (`simplicio`) when\\n13: it is available on PATH. This is an optional, silent integration \u2014 the loop never blocks\\n14: or changes behaviour when the CLI is absent.\\n15: \\n16: ### What the loop calls\\n17: \\n18: | CLI command | Where | When | Effect |\\n19: |---|---|---|---|\"\n        },\n        \"tests\": [],\n        \"path\": \".claude/skills/simplicio-loop/references/cross-repo-integration.md\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"content\": null,\n        \"span\": {\n          \"start\": 1,\n          \"end\": 19,\n          \"text\": \"1: <!-- simplicio-contract:begin -->\\n2: contract: simplicio-loop/extension-points\\n3: schema: simplicio.skill-reference/v1\\n4: purpose: These are the named points where work happens.\\n5: rules: Read only when the parent SKILL.md points here; mutable data lives in the footer, never in this header.\\n6: <!-- simplicio-contract:end -->\\n7: \\n8: # Extension points \u2014 the 50 named binding points\\n9: \\n10: These are the named points where work happens. For each, if the host runtime exposes a native\\n11: capability, BIND it (deterministic, local-first, near-zero token). If not, the LLM performs the\\n12: fallback with standard tools. The skill depends on the ABSTRACTION, never on a specific runtime.\\n13: \\n14: | Extension point | What it does | LLM fallback (always available) 